OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fstart to the evening with sunny
OL,7,Fspells. The rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fmostly dry with some clear spells, but
OL,9,Falso the odd light shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAny early showers across
OL,12,Fnorthern areas will soon clear,
OL,13,Fleaving a bright day with plenty of
OL,14,Fwarm sunny spells. Sunshine will turn
OL,15,Fa little hazy at times through the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
